      <Docs>
        <summary>Returns the current grammatical gender for the calling app.</summary>
        <value>the value of grammatical gender. Value is one of the following: Configuration.GRAMMATICAL_GENDER_NOT_SPECIFIED Configuration.GRAMMATICAL_GENDER_NEUTRAL Configuration.GRAMMATICAL_GENDER_FEMININE Configuration.GRAMMATICAL_GENDER_MASCULINE</value>
        <remarks>
          <para>Returns the current grammatical gender for the calling app. A new value can be requested via setRequestedApplicationGrammaticalGender(int) and will be updated with a new configuration change. The method always returns the value received with the last received configuration change.</para>
          <para>See also:</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/GrammaticalInflectionManager#getApplicationGrammaticalGender()" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.GrammaticalInflectionManager.getApplicationGrammaticalGender</code>.</a></format></para>
