      <Docs>
        <summary>Allows privileged preloaded applications to get the system grammatical gender when set.</summary>
        <value>The value of system grammatical gender only if the calling app has the permission, otherwise throwing an exception. Value is one of the following: Configuration.GRAMMATICAL_GENDER_NOT_SPECIFIED Configuration.GRAMMATICAL_GENDER_NEUTRAL Configuration.GRAMMATICAL_GENDER_FEMININE Configuration.GRAMMATICAL_GENDER_MASCULINE</value>
        <remarks>
          <para>Allows privileged preloaded applications to get the system grammatical gender when set. Requires android.Manifest.permission.READ_SYSTEM_GRAMMATICAL_GENDER</para>
          <para>See also:</para>
          <para>Throws: SecurityException If the caller does not have the required permission.</para>
